# Only deliberately selected root files belong in the public edition.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.zshrc
!/.p10k.zsh
!/README.md
!/LICENSE
!/THIRD_PARTY.md
!/PROVENANCE.md
!/assets/
!/LICENSES/
!/scripts/
!/kde/

# Defense in depth; these patterns cannot replace review and secret scanning.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.ssh/
**/.aws/
**/wireguard/
**/id_rsa*
**/id_ed25519*
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/credentials*
**/*history*
**/*.conf
**/*.log
**/*.bak
**/*.swp
**/*~
**/.DS_Store
